Stat cards grid.

Tables:
```css
.admin-table-wrap { margin-top:16px; overflow-x:auto; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); }
.admin-table { width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:14px; }
