.admin-table__number { text-align:right; white-space:nowrap;}
```
The `.admin-table` th/td styles need `.admin-table th` etc.

`admin-nav`:
```css
.admin-nav { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; margin-top:20px; }
.admin-nav__link { padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px; border:1px solid var(--line); background:var(--surface); font-size:14px; font-weight:600; color:var(--ink-soft); text-decoration:none; }
.admin-nav__link--active { color:#fff; background:var(--accent); border-color:var(--accent); }
